sequenceDiagram
    actor Customer as PER-001 (Customer)
    actor FraudAnalyst as PER-054 (Fraud Analyst)
    participant Channel as SVC-017<br/>Digital Channels
    participant IAM as SVC-100<br/>IAM
    participant DomPay as SVC-009<br/>Domestic Payments
    participant Retail as SVC-001<br/>Retail Banking Core
    participant EventBus as SVC-102<br/>Event Bus
    participant Sanctions as SVC-051<br/>Sanctions Screening
    participant Fraud as SVC-013<br/>Fraud Detection
    participant FraudPlatform as INTL-003<br/>Fraud Ops Platform
    participant Audit as SVC-103<br/>Audit & Logging

    Note over Customer,Audit: PY-001 — Payment Initiation (CoP no_match)

    Customer->>Channel: Enter payee details (new payee, £2,500 — unusual amount)
    Channel->>DomPay: POST /cop/verify {payee_sort_code, payee_account_number, payee_name}
    DomPay-->>Channel: 200 OK {cop_result: no_match, risk_warning_required: true}
    Channel-->>Customer: ⚠️ PSR SD17 risk warning: "Name does not match — this could be fraud"<br/>Confirm / Cancel buttons

    Customer->>Channel: Click "I understand the risk — proceed" (explicit override, timestamp recorded)
    Customer->>Channel: Complete SCA (biometric)
    Channel->>IAM: POST /sca/validate {assertion, payee_sort_code, payee_account_number, amount: 2500.00}
    IAM-->>Channel: 200 OK {sca_assertion_ref, valid: true}

    Channel->>Retail: POST /payments {amount: 2500.00, cop_result: no_match,<br/>cop_override_confirmed: true, cop_override_timestamp, sca_assertion_ref}
    Note right of Retail: Balance OK, limit OK. Create PaymentIntent<br/>(status: pending_screening, cop_override recorded).
    Retail-->>Channel: 202 Accepted {payment_intent_id, status: pending_screening}
    Retail->>EventBus: Publish PaymentIntentCreated (EVT-P01) — includes cop_override_confirmed: true
    EventBus->>Audit: Write EVT-P01 to WORM audit log
    Channel-->>Customer: Show "Processing your payment..." screen

    Note over Customer,Audit: PY-002 — Pre-Execution Checks (concurrent, async)

    par Sanctions (clear)
        EventBus->>Sanctions: Consume PaymentIntentCreated → run sanctions screen
        Sanctions->>EventBus: Publish SanctionsScreeningCompleted (EVT-P02) {outcome: clear}
    and Fraud scoring (BLOCK)
        EventBus->>Fraud: Consume PaymentIntentCreated → run ML fraud scoring
        Note right of Fraud: High score: new payee + CoP no_match override<br/>+ amount 5x account average
        Fraud->>EventBus: Publish FraudScoreCompleted (EVT-P03)<br/>{risk_level: block, fraud_score: 0.94,<br/>top_risk_features: [cop_no_match_override,<br/>unusual_amount_vs_history, new_payee]}
    end

    EventBus->>Audit: Write EVT-P02 and EVT-P03 (risk_level only) to audit log

    Note over Customer,Audit: PY-003 — Payment Decision (FRAUD BLOCK)

    EventBus->>Retail: Consume EVT-P02 (clear) + EVT-P03 (BLOCK)
    Note right of Retail: Decision: FRAUD BLOCK.<br/>Update PaymentIntent.status = fraud_blocked.<br/>No account debit.
    Retail->>EventBus: Publish PaymentFraudBlocked (EVT-P08)<br/>{risk_level: block, top_risk_features, payment_intent_id}
    EventBus->>Audit: Write EVT-P08 to WORM audit log

    EventBus->>FraudPlatform: Consume PaymentFraudBlocked → create investigation case
    FraudPlatform->>FraudAnalyst: 🚨 Case alert: £2,500 blocked — CoP override + high fraud score

    Channel->>Retail: GET /payments/{payment_intent_id} (polling)
    Retail-->>Channel: 200 OK {status: fraud_blocked, failure_reason: generic_decline}
    Note right of Channel: fraud_blocked status known internally.<br/>failure_reason: generic_decline shown to customer<br/>(no fraud detail disclosed).
    Channel-->>Customer: "We've blocked this payment for your security.<br/>If you authorised this, call [fraud line].<br/>No money has left your account."

    Note over FraudAnalyst,FraudPlatform: Out-of-band: Fraud Analyst reviews case<br/>(full score + features + account history + device data)<br/>→ confirms true positive fraud block
